Subject: [PATCH 259/262] 4930: a paused goal waits on its owner, not with the
 solved ones
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Giorgi (13 Oct): every „შეჩერებულია" case belongs in „შენს პასუხს
ელოდება". A paused goal's thread read done (5 of the 6 paused in 30
days) and sat in the solved list. The honest status now reads needs_you
for a thread whose goal is paused and none open, with no stale status
line, and the list row says goal_paused for the card's label.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HwFREQwL5g9E6qRrUf9bau
